abstract: >-
  Architecture as Truth (AAT) is a way of building software in which the
  architecture documents (the decisions, the contracts, the behaviours and the
  plan) are the single source of truth about the product. People decide by
  changing those documents, AI agents build from them, and everything that
  ships is reconciled back into them. The wording is five principles and four
  rules for an AI agent.
